# Prishe's Wanderings ({2}{G}, instant): "Search your library for a basic land card or Town card, put it onto the battlefield
# tapped, then shuffle. When you search your library this way, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control." Tropical
# Island is a land but neither basic nor a Town and can't be found (CR 701.23, 205.4a); Capital City, a Town, is, and enters
# tapped; the library is shuffled once. The reflexive ability (CR 603.12) is put on the stack afterwards and chooses its
# target then: Bot2's Llanowar Elves (an opponent's creature) and Bot1's Moxen (not creatures) are not legal, so Bot1's own
# Llanowar Elves is the only target, chosen without a prompt, and becomes 2/2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Prishe's Wanderings
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Forest
Tropical Island
Capital City
